That was a long battle; you went through many hardships.
Thank you very much for all your effort and bravery.

We have finally put an end to Midranda's tyranny. Now the Pristonians and the water people can live in peace.
The constant tremors caused by the Fire Soul worry me a great deal. The Blue Horse's words are on my mind. But let us work hard to help the Pristonians and the water people recover.
Please, take the good news to Commander Derik.

[Challenge Objective]

Deliver the Top Secret Document to Commander Derik in Ricarten.
